# Keep internal working files off the public CDN.
#
# Found 2026-09-07 during a Search Console audit: these were all being served
# publicly on the client's own domain, and Google had actually indexed
# /content-export/footer-template (a raw footer fragment carrying the salon's
# NAP) because it was listed in sitemap.xml.
#
# content-export/ is the dead Webflow-migration artifact. It also contains a
# VERBATIM duplicate of every blog post under content-export/blog/ — those were
# not indexed (nothing links to them) but they are a standing duplicate-content
# risk against the posts that actually rank.
#
# Nothing in the site references any of these paths.

content-export/

# Internal WES docs — playbooks, client email drafts, project notes
*.md
.claude/

# Source archive, not a web asset
Color Gallery.zip
